   "title": "When something goes wrong, customers cannot reach a person, get their money back or get the work fixed",
   "evidence_summary": "468 reviews (18.5%) describe a recourse failure: 188 cannot reach support (bot loops, no number), 124 have refund or payment problems, 92 report unresolved complaints, 99 are refused warranty or rework and 94 describe Native purifier installation or after-sales failures. It is 79.7% Negative and appears in all four sources (61.8% of PissedConsumer and 53.4% of ConsumerComplaints reviews, 11.8% of Google Play). 231 of the 468 also describe a primary failure first, so poor recourse compounds other problems.",
